eeb5><header class="post-header" data-v-29b3eeb5 data-v-01b90259><div class="post-header__bg" data-v-01b90259><div class="bg-canvas__wrapper white" data-v-01b90259 data-v-6ffb6bc3><canvas data-v-6ffb6bc3></canvas></div></div><div class="post-header__content" data-v-01b90259><div class="post-header__meta label-4" data-v-01b90259>technical-index • December 9, 2025</div><h1 class="post-header__title title-h1" data-v-01b90259>Case Study: How Ryder Achieved 50%+ Throughput Gains with AI Yard Automation</h1><!----></div><!----></header><div class="post-content" data-v-29b3eeb5><div class="author-container post-author" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person" data-v-29b3eeb5 data-v-dd1fd95f><h2 class="about-the-author" data-v-dd1fd95f>About the Author</h2><div class="author-info" data-v-dd1fd95f><div class="author-metadata" data-v-dd1fd95f><img onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt data-nuxt-img srcset="/__replay/source/a.storyblok.com/f/337048/420x420/2b235317ec/terminal-symbol-black.png 1x, /__replay/source/a.storyblok.com/f/337048/420x420/2b235317ec/terminal-symbol-black.png 2x" class="author-avatar" itemprop="image" src="/__replay/source/a.storyblok.com/f/337048/420x420/2b235317ec/terminal-symbol-black.png" data-v-dd1fd95f><div class="author-details" data-v-dd1fd95f><p class="author-name" itemprop="name" data-v-dd1fd95f>Terminal Industries Staff</p><p class="author-role" itemprop="jobTitle" data-v-dd1fd95f>Terminal Team</p></div></div><p class="author-bio" itemprop="description" data-v-dd1fd95f>Coming together in collaboration, the staff of Terminal Industries unites diverse expertise in logistics, technology, and operations to deliver forward-thinking insights. As a collective, they are leaders in shaping the future of the yard with innovation and measurable impact. </p></div><a href="/contact" class="author-cta-button button label-4 author-cta-button" style="--hover-bg:rgba(5, 36, 36, 1);--hover-color:rgba(171, 255, 2, 1);--base-color:rgba(5, 36, 36, 1);" data-v-dd1fd95f data-v-d8fa3fef><span class="link-active" data-v-d8fa3fef><!--[--> Talk to an expert <!--]--></span></a></div><div data-v-29b3eeb5><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-v-29b3eeb5 data-v-ff0d7e07><ol class="breadcrumbs-list" data-v-ff0d7e07><!--[--><li class="breadcrumbs-item" data-v-ff0d7e07><a href="/resources" class="breadcrumbs-link" data-v-ff0d7e07>Resources</a><span class="breadcrumbs-separator" aria-hidden="true" data-v-ff0d7e07>/</span></li><li class="breadcrumbs-item" data-v-ff0d7e07><span class="breadcrumbs-current" aria-current="page" data-v-ff0d7e07>Case Study: How Ryder Achieved 50%+ Throughput Gains with AI Yard Automation</span><!----></li><!--]--></ol></nav><div id="summarize-button" class="summarize-button" style="padding-bottom:16px;" data-v-29b3eeb5></div><div class="post-content-wrapper post-content-body" data-v-29b3eeb5 data-v-1c7eea09><div class="prose prose-lg prose-gray max-w-3xl prose-headings:font-medium prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-p:text-gray-600 prose-a:text-green-700 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline prose-strong:font-semibold prose-img:rounded-lg prose-hr:border-gray-200" data-v-1c7eea09><!--[--><p data-v-1c7eea09><strong data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Quick Answer: </span></strong><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Ryder System, Inc. partnered with Terminal Industries to modernize six high-volume e-commerce fulfillment and maintenance sites. By deploying Terminal’s AI-native Yard Operating System (YOS™), Ryder achieved a 99% accuracy rate across more than 10,000 truck detections. The implementation resulted in an 85% reduction in gate processing time—dropping from an average of 14 minutes to under 2 minutes—and a projected 5.7x ROI over a three-year period.</span></p><h2 id="what-were-the-results-of-the-ryder-and-terminal-industries-pilot" class="heading-anchor" data-v-1c7eea09>What were the results of the Ryder and Terminal Industries pilot?</h2><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>The collaboration focused on digitizing manual, error-prone yard processes using proprietary AI Computer Vision. The results established new benchmarks for yard execution:</span></p><ul data-v-1c7eea09><li data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><strong data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Detections &amp; Accuracy: </span></strong><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Processed over 10,000 truck detections with 99% accuracy in capturing license plates and Department of Transportation (DOT) numbers, even in inclement weather and low-light conditions.</span></p></li><li data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><strong data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Gate Efficiency: </span></strong><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Reduced gate processing time by 85%.</span></p></li><li data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><strong data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Labor Savings: </span></strong><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Achieved a 90% reduction in time spent by personnel manually searching for assets in the yard.</span></p></li><li data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><strong data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Cost Avoidance:</span></strong><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09> Reduced driver detention fees by 12% and trailer detention/demurrage by 5%+.</span></p></li></ul><h2 id="how-did-terminal-industries-improve-ryder-s-yard-throughput" class="heading-anchor" data-v-1c7eea09>How did Terminal Industries improve Ryder&#39;s yard throughput?</h2><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Ryder faced significant bottlenecks due to manual logs and inefficient trailer status visibility. Terminal replaced these legacy workflows with Gate Acceleration™, an AI-native module that automates data capture.</span></p><h3 id="key-solutions-implemented" class="heading-anchor" data-v-1c7eea09>Key Solutions Implemented:</h3><ul data-v-1c7eea09><li data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><strong data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Automated ID Capture: </span></strong><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Cameras automatically indexed identifying information from moving vehicles entering and exiting the yard, eliminating the need for drivers to exit their cabs or guards to manually record data.</span></p></li><li data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><strong data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Mobile Inventory Management: </span></strong><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>At Ryder maintenance facilities, Terminal’s technology was deployed on mobile tablets to auto-capture stationary truck inventory.</span></p></li><li data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><strong data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Data Enrichment: </span></strong><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Terminal integrated its vision data with third-party databases to provide full vehicle profiles, compensating for common manual recording errors.</span></p></li></ul><table data-v-1c7eea09><tbody data-v-1c7eea09><tr data-v-1c7eea09><td data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>Metric</span></p></td><td data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>Ryder Pre-Terminal</span></p></td><td style="width: 109px;" data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>Ryder Post-Terminal</span></p></td></tr><tr data-v-1c7eea09><td data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>Gate Check-In Time</span></p></td><td data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>~14 Minutes</span></p></td><td style="width: 109px;" data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>&lt; 2 Minutes</span></p></td></tr><tr data-v-1c7eea09><td data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>Identification Accuracy</span></p></td><td data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>Variable (Manual)</span></p></td><td style="width: 109px;" data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>99%</span></p></td></tr><tr data-v-1c7eea09><td data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>Asset Search Effort</span></p></td><td data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>High Manual Cost</span></p></td><td style="width: 109px;" data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>90% Reduction</span></p></td></tr><tr data-v-1c7eea09><td data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>Estimated ROI</span></p></td><td data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>N/A</span></p></td><td style="width: 109px;" data-v-1c7eea09><p data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #1F1F1F" data-v-1c7eea09>5.7x (3-year contract)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-v-1c7eea09><strong data-v-1c7eea09><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Strategic Milestone: </span></strong><span style="color: #191A1B" data-v-1c7eea09>Karen Jones, CMO of Ryder, noted that this level of accuracy with computer vision is a &quot;significant milestone&quot; in modernizing what has historically been a manual and inefficient industry. The success of the initial pilots led to further expansion across Ryder’s network of over 700 yards.</span></p><!--]--></div><div class="tag-button-list mt-8" data-v-1c7eea09 data-v-95826a6e><!--[--><!--]--></div><div class="post-actions" data-v-1c7eea09><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><button class="ds-button button label-4 ds-button" style="--hover-bg:rgba(5, 36, 36, 1);--hover-color:rgba(171, 255, 2, 1);--base-color:rgba(5, 36, 36, 1);" id="reka-dr